        DEFENSIVE_STANCE = { "Steadfastness begins where others seek shelter. If they want my friends, they must convince my shield.", "*sets the shield before the allies; widens the stance and lifts the shield before the allies.*", "Memories of lost worlds weigh upon my resolve. The loudest roar won't win this one.", "*breathes deeply and settles into calm focus; drops the centre of gravity and becomes a wall behind the guard.*" },
